OL,3,GNEWSAParade commemorates 9/11 Cornish
OL,4,Ahero
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parade and ceremony has honoured a
OL,7,FCornish hero who died saving thousands
OL,8,Fof lives during the 9/11 World Trade
OL,9,FCenter attacks in New York 25 years
OL,10,Fago.
OL,12,FRick Rescorla was head of security for
OL,13,FMorgan Stanley and was working in the
OL,14,FSouth Tower on 11 September 2001. He
OL,15,Fevacuated more than 2,500 people from
OL,16,Fthe building before returning inside -
OL,17,Fhis body was never found.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
