OL,3,GNEWSAParade commemorates 9/11 Cornish
OL,4,Ahero
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren from Hayle's Penpol Primary
OL,7,FSchool, where Rescorla was a former
OL,8,Fpupil, took part in the parade
OL,9,Falongside members of the Royal Navy,
OL,10,FBritish Army, Royal Air Force and
OL,11,FParachute Regiment.
OL,13,FHayle town clerk Eleanor Giggal said
OL,14,Fthey wanted future generations to
OL,15,Fremember what Rescorla did.
